      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Content is hidden when switching apps.\nEverything stays only in the device's encrypted database;\nnothing goes to the system backup (SP-25).\nChanging biometrics does not delete data (SP-26).\nOffline, the safe default applies (SP-24).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
